1
00:00:00,111 --> 00:00:02,620
In 1939, this was Europe.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,700
Two years later, Hitler controlled most of it.

3
00:00:05,888 --> 00:00:07,760
September 1st, 1939.

4
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:09,660
Germany invades Poland.

5
00:00:10,178 --> 00:00:11,700
Britain and France declare war.

6
00:00:12,185 --> 00:00:14,400
In 1940, the tanks roll west.

7
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:17,380
France, with one of the biggest armies on Earth,

8
00:00:17,811 --> 00:00:19,160
falls in just six weeks.

9
00:00:19,721 --> 00:00:21,260
Britain refuses to surrender.

10
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,140
So Hitler turns east.

11
00:00:23,697 --> 00:00:26,740
Over three million troops pour into the Soviet Union.

12
00:00:27,202 --> 00:00:30,000
By December, they're less than twenty miles from Moscow.

13
00:00:30,581 --> 00:00:33,940
Then, on December 7th, Japan attacks Pearl Harbor.

14
00:00:34,412 --> 00:00:36,400
Part two: how it all fell apart.

